WEBVTT

00:02:28.935 --> 00:02:30.665
with the same level of proficiency

00:02:30.689 --> 00:02:32.554
were making different amounts of money.

00:02:32.578 --> 00:02:34.935
So immediately, they
calculated the difference,

00:02:34.959 --> 00:02:38.506
and they invested three million dollars
to try and balance things out.

00:02:39.065 --> 00:02:41.246
Idea number three is listening.

00:02:41.617 --> 00:02:45.308
So, to be a listener who connects
with all types of people,

00:02:45.332 --> 00:02:47.419
we have to unlearn a few things.

00:02:47.443 --> 00:02:51.411
We've all been taught about
active listening and eye contact --

00:02:51.435 --> 00:02:53.165
an intense stare

00:02:53.189 --> 00:02:54.911
and a compassionate look.

00:02:54.935 --> 00:02:56.114
That's not listening.

00:02:56.138 --> 00:02:59.200
Repeating what the person says --
that's not listening.

00:02:59.224 --> 00:03:00.433
Being humble